\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\\\"\\u003eteam\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"\\u003e of passionate professionals who are strong thought leaders and natural team players, enjoying reimagining the future and crafting global solutions. And we do not believe that age, gender, ethnicity or physical differences define one's potential. We believe in nurturing talent and enjoy an open-door, all-time-access culture.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"\\u003eOur \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.yournest.in/portfolio\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\\\"\\u003eportfolio\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"\\u003e companies are at the forefront of innovation and are always looking for talented individuals to join their teams. If you are passionate about technology and committed to the startup ecosystem, you’ve come to the right place. Our startups\\u0026nbsp;offer a range of open positions to drive your career. We encourage candidates with a strong entrepreneurial spirit and a desire to make a difference to apply and join something truly extraordinary. We look forward to welcoming new talent to YourNest and our portfolio companies – a dynamic set of ‘Challengineer’ founders whose ambitions we actively support.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"primary_brand_colour\":\"#bd400a\",\"secondary_brand_colour\":\"#000000\",\"image_path\":\"files/company/img/YourNest_Logo-highres_66C543C18E.jpg\",\"image_url\":\"https://assets.pyjamahr.com/backend/files/company/img/YourNest_Logo-highres_66C543C18E.jpg\",\"uuid\":\"987EE7EF32\",\"phone_number\":\"+917666750052\",\"email\":\"openings@yournest.in\",\"banner_image_path\":\"files/company/img/banner/Careers_Page_Banner_Des